notes.content:
- Added initial room bonus: "Vending Machine";
- Added some new rooms;
- Fixed bugs.

Major updates:
- Added the Japanese language.

Other updates:
- Adjusted the selling price and recovery effect of Coins and Energy sold in the shop;
- Added more detailed screen setting options;
- Added more items and enemies;
- Added display of current active item energy consumption;
- Fixed the knockback bullet BUG;
- Fixed the BUG with coins appearing outside the room;
- Fixed logic bugs for some enemies.

Happy New Year! Thank you for your support! ♪(･ω･)ﾉ

v 0.1.8
- Added a boss, the Bunny Girl;
- Designed unique weapons and bullet effects for each character;
- Fixed a bug that reported an error in the opening screen of some event rooms;
- Adjusted the operation logic and damage of melee-type weapons such as lightsabers;
- Adjusted the logic of some bosses;
- Added more monster sounds.

- Optimized the animation and logic of the Cyborg Guard BOSS & Human Army Commander BOSS;
- Modified the bug that caused the Werewolf BOSS to occasionally rush out of the room;
- Modified the bug that caused negative movement speed due to overflowing data after stacking some temporary effects;
- Optimized the view to better display the rooms;
- Added some sound effects.

- Fixed a bug with resource items not dropping / very low drop rates;
- Fixed a bug in the number of unlocked items in Level 8;
- Fixed some bugs in the item logic.

-Optimized the loading speed;
-Fixed the bugs on the handle operation; 
-Fixed some bugs on several items.

Thank you for your support! Wish you a merry Christmas in advance!
